-- SHADOWING - /home/charles/Warlock/implementation/warlock/src/ShortcutPreferences.elm

The name `pending` is first defined here:

92|                 pending = if settled then Nothing else model.pending
                    ^^^^^^^
But then it is defined AGAIN over here:

85|                 settled = model.pending |> Maybe.map (\pending -> current.choices==pending.choices && liveMatches pending.choices native) |> Maybe.withDefault False
                                                           ^^^^^^^
Think of a more helpful name for one of them and you should be all set!

Note: Linters advise against shadowing, so Elm makes “best practices” the
default. Read <https://elm-lang.org/0.19.2/shadowing> for more details on this
choice.

